# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository. Git converts on checkout
# for anyone working on Windows, so a CRLF editor stays usable. Eight files
# predate the ADR-011 Linux migration and still carry CRLF in the index; see
# the renormalize note in the commit that added this file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never line-ending-converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary

# Give diff hunk headers the enclosing function name (the text after @@).
*.c   diff=cpp
*.h   diff=cpp
*.cpp diff=cpp

# Generated GL 3.3 core loader, kept in-tree because it has no upstream to
# fetch (external/CMakeLists.txt). Not ours to review, and it should not count
# toward the repository's language statistics.
external/glad/** linguist-vendored
